# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  SERVER — .gitignore
#  Files listed here are IGNORED by Git.
#  ✅  Safe to share with team → .env.example  (template only)
#  🚫  Never commit              → .env         (real secrets)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets & environment ────────────────────────────────────
# Contains MongoDB Atlas URI, JWT secrets, AI API keys.
# Each team member creates their OWN .env from .env.example
.env

# ── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Re-installed via: npm install
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# ── User-uploaded files ──────────────────────────────────────
# PDFs / DOCX files uploaded by users — NOT source code
uploads/

# ── Generated PDF reports ────────────────────────────────────
uploads/reports/
*.pdf

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── OS / Editor junk ─────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
